"""
Phase 8.3 — Deterministic Knowledge Taxonomy

Purpose
-------
Provide a large, manually controlled vocabulary for organizing large
college knowledge collections.

This layer DOES NOT:
- use an LLM
- use embeddings
- use a vector database
- chunk documents
- summarize or rewrite knowledge

This layer ONLY:
- classifies knowledge sections deterministically
- assigns domain/category/subcategory
- preserves useful unknown content through REVIEW
- provides a controlled vocabulary for Phase 8.4

Design
------
domain
    category
        subcategory

The taxonomy is intentionally richer than the final number of DOCX files.
Phase 8.4 decides how these taxonomy buckets become final RAG documents.
"""

